glossary.definition:
(1) "School representative" includes all of the following:

(a) An employee of a school district, chartered nonpublic school, or county board of developmental disabilities;

(b) An employee of an entity with which a school district, chartered nonpublic school, or county board of developmental disabilities contracts for the provision of services;

(c) A member of a school district board of education, chartered nonpublic school governing body, or county board of developmental disabilities.
